    {"type":"text","id":"oq_title","x":40,"y":470,"width":300,"height":20,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"seed":320011,"version":1,"versionNonce":320012,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Open questions","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Open questions","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"oq_body","x":40,"y":500,"width":680,"height":175,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"seed":320013,"version":1,"versionNonce":320014,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"- Where does the Better Stack path drop spans from non-consented\n  tenants? The runner reads by env:region and service name, not tenant.\n- Better Stack retention and region for AIWS spans are undocumented,\n  and a tenant purge in AgentScore does not delete them there.\n- Is the Better Stack stream the long-term mechanism? It is called an\n  'interim supply line' and is off by default.\n- Does disabling the consent flag stop ingest immediately?\n- Disabling an API key does not stop AI Workspace traces, so the\n  consent flag is the only control on that path.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"- Where does the Better Stack path drop spans from non-consented\n  tenants? The runner reads by env:region and service name, not tenant.\n- Better Stack retention and region for AIWS spans are undocumented,\n  and a tenant purge in AgentScore does not delete them there.\n- Is the Better Stack stream the long-term mechanism? It is called an\n  'interim supply line' and is off by default.\n- Does disabling the consent flag stop ingest immediately?\n- Disabling an API key does not stop AI Workspace traces, so the\n  consent flag is the only control on that path.","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"legend","x":40,"y":720,"width":500,"height":18,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"seed":320015,"version":1,"versionNonce":320016,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Dashed outline = proposed, planned, or not yet confirmed","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Dashed outline = proposed, planned, or not yet confirmed","lineHeight":1.25}
